# Components Used

## Arduino Uno
- Microcontroller used for servo control
- Chosen for simplicity and compatibility

## MG90S Servos
- Metal gear micro servos
- Provide sufficient torque for robotic arm

## 5V Power Supply
- External regulated supply
- Required to handle servo current

## EEZYbotARM
- 3D printed robotic arm structure
- Lightweight and beginner-friendly

---

## Why External Power?
Servos draw high current. Using Arduino 5V causes instability.

---

## Alternatives
- PCA9685 servo driver
- Raspberry Pi (for high-level control)
